<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market no help.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market no help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it did not operate in the UK money market despite offering an early round of assistance on Monday morning.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
